   THIRD-PARTY AND DATA NOTICES

   * MobilityData/gtfs-validator (Apache-2.0) is vendored as a binary at
     vendor/gtfs-validator-8.0.1-cli.jar and is pinned by sha256. It is not
     modified. https://github.com/MobilityData/gtfs-validator

   * Timetable source documents from Assam State Transport Corporation are
     public government publications retrieved from their published URLs. They
     are neither redistributed nor modified by this repository; only their
     URLs and content hashes are recorded. See docs/INTEL_INDIA.md for the
     licensing basis under the Government Open Data Licence - India.

   * Geocoding results are derived from OpenStreetMap via the Nominatim
     service and are (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open
     Database License (ODbL). https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
     Cached results in fixtures/geocode/ carry their OSM object ids so each
     one is attributable to its source object.

   * Feeds produced by this software are UNOFFICIAL development feeds and are
     labelled as such in feed_info.txt. They are not endorsed by any transit
     operator and must not be presented as an operator's official data.
